-ri was one of many minbuk propaganda villages established by the Park Chung Hee regime in the 1960s to showcase the farming bounty and prosperity of the south for a North Korean gaze. The village was formerly part of the Civilian Control Line (CCL) until 2013 when it was reterritorialized as a normal part of South Korea.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"War\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1137942,\"title\":\"My Nights Glow Yellow\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1luFfiIfPxfAPf8WEQkWYEfMcxY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A platonic companion for hire wrestles with her own longing for true connection.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":545611,\"title\":\"Everything Everywhere All at Once\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u68AjlvlutfEIcpmbYpKcdi09ut.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fIwiFha3WPu5nHkBeMQ4GzEk0Hv.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An aging Chinese immigrant is swept up in an insane adventure, where she alone can save what's important to her by connecting with the lives she could have led in other universes.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":535422,\"title\":\"Lullaby\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/knRmNF37x0rw3TMOSJhWY6Qm5uZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a typical Singaporean family of three, life is well and comfortable. Unbeknownst to them, the forgotten fourth member is feeling neglected and alone. The only comfort she finds lies in her grandson.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":934198,\"title\":\"Stay the Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8z9cGlYlbn7ASsHJJMRx8hh6Sv2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r7Ph2dFHq0UZhorYJ1DYYimVBlV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A 